1
00:00:00,741 --> 00:00:04,811
(Penny:)the order is petting zoo first,
then buy vegetables.

2
00:00:07,713 --> 00:00:09,383
(Raj:)Hey.

3
00:00:09,383 --> 00:00:12,053
(Sheldon:)Oh, good. You're here.
I need your assistance.

4
00:00:12,052 --> 00:00:14,652
(Leonard:)Can it wait until I put
a Band-Aid on a goat bite?

5
00:00:16,289 --> 00:00:17,959
(Sheldon:)What happened?
Oh.

6
00:00:17,958 --> 00:00:20,388
(Penny:)Your buddy got mugged
by some baby farm animals.

7
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:23,400
(Sheldon:)Been there.
Mmm.

8
00:00:23,397 --> 00:00:25,327
(Penny:)So what do you need help with?

9
00:00:25,332 --> 00:00:28,502
(Sheldon:)Amy's mad at me,
and I'm not clear why.

10
00:00:28,502 --> 00:00:30,832
(Penny:)Okay. Were you talking
before she got upset?

11
00:00:30,837 --> 00:00:32,367
(Sheldon:)Yes.
That's probably it.

12
00:00:33,339 --> 00:00:35,469
(Penny:)What'd you say to her?

13
00:00:35,475 --> 00:00:37,645
(Sheldon:)Well, I just asked her
if I should start watching

14
00:00:37,644 --> 00:00:39,344
the new Flash TV series.

15
00:00:39,346 --> 00:00:40,846
(Penny:)And that made her angry?

16
00:00:40,847 --> 00:00:42,847
(Sheldon:)Baffling, right? We were necking

17
00:00:42,849 --> 00:00:45,689
(Sheldon:)like a couple of hooligans
under the school bleachers.

18
00:00:45,686 --> 00:00:48,316
(Sheldon:)I stopped so I could ask
the question.

19
00:00:48,322 --> 00:00:53,062
(Sheldon:)Next thing I know, good-bye,
kissy face. Hello, yelly face.

20
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:55,190
(Penny:)Well, Sheldon, when
you're kissing a girl,

21
00:00:55,195 --> 00:00:57,595
(Penny:)she expects the
attention to be on her.

22
00:00:57,598 --> 00:00:59,268
(Sheldon:)It was. I asked her

23
00:00:59,266 --> 00:01:01,936
if she thought
I should watch The Flash.

